diagram(dir="right")

  card#deck.deck(icon="folder-open") A presentation
    | slides.md: text, diagrams, code
    | terminals, images
    to(glitu)

  card#glitu.tool(icon="terminal") glitu
    | build · serve
    | glitu-core compiler
    | skemo diagrams
    to(offline online site)

  zone#outputs.output What you get
    card#offline.output(icon="file-down") Offline
      | one file, everything inside
    card#online.output(icon="globe") Online
      | a short HTML
      to(static).dashed loads
    card#site.output(icon="refresh-cw") Local site
      | glitu serve, like Hugo

  card#static.static(icon="cloud") static.glitu.net
    | engine, themes
    | one version per folder

  card#maintainer.maintainer(icon="user-cog") Maintainer
    | glitu-site static
    to(static).dashed publishes
